  \expnd0\expndtw0 is the open area where all the runners merge, directly under the carburetor(s) or after\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 throttle\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 body\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 on\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 fuel\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 injected\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 manifolds.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 The\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 best\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 example\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 of\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 plenum\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 is\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 very\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 evident\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 "box"\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 on\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 "tunnel\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 ram" type manifolds.\par\pard\plain\s12\ls10\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1079\fi-360\ri1188\qj\sl242\slmult1\tx1079\f0\fs20\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 The end which is open to atmosphere (or air cleaner) on individual\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 runner fuel\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 injection or carburetion.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 For "individual runner" carb systems, the runner length actually extends through the carb and through any velocity stack or air horn.\par\pard\plain\s12\ls10\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1078\fi-359\qj\sl240\slmult1\tx1078\f0\fs20\b0\i0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Any\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 point\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 where\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 runner from\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 one\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 cylinder\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 merges\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 with\expnd0\expndtw1  \expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd0\expndtw-1  