rst screen lets you choose a category under which to save the example.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 For example, you may want a category called VW (as shown in Figure 2.49) where you would save Volkswagen manifolds.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Categories lets you easily\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 organize large numbers of examples. To choose a category, simply click on one of the categories on the right side of the screen, under Examples Added by User.\expnd13\expndtw63  \expnd0\expndtw0 (Note\expnd8\expndtw40\charscalex100  \expnd0\expndtw0 that\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 you can not\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 add examples to examples provided by\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 Performance Trends on the left\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 side.)\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Then click on Use Category\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 to save\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\par
