expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 You may say that the Coolant Temp and Fuel Octane inputs suggested here would be complete guesses on your part.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 In cases like that where you are not sure of specs, calculate performance with a guess at the specs, then calculate performance again with a significantly\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 different\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 guess.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 If performance does not\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 change much, that\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 particular spec must\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 not\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 be that\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 important\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 for your particular combination, so either guess is adequate.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 If it does show a big effect, then you will have to read the section of the manual which discusses it to come up with a better estimate of the\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 real value.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb6\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s10\ls34\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li764\fi-404\sl240\slmult1\tx764\f2\fs28\b1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Save\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 Your\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 New\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw-2 Engine\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\ri731\sl244\slmult1\sb236\f0\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 You are probably anxious to run your engine and see its results, but first change the Engine Comments to reflect the changes you\'92ve made.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Click in the Comments box at the Main Screen.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Change the comments the same as you would for most any Windows text editing\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 or\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 word\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 processing\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 program.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 See\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 Figure\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 4.13.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Remember\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 that\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 these\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 comments\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 should\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 help remind\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 you\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 of\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 what\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 this\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 engine\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 is, even several years in the future.\par\sect\sectd\sbknone\cols2\colno1\colw8530\colsr40\colno2\colw3310
