\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li359\ri821\sl244\slmult1\sb236\f0\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Check the Supercharger menu as shown in Figure 4.38.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 You first\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 want\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 to check the performance potential\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 of the 302-4V with a turbocharger.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 First you must switch the Supercharger Type in the upper left corner from None to Turbocharger to indicate a turbocharger is now installed on the engine.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Notice the turbocharger specs now become enabled (not dimmed gray) so you can change them.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 These specs require inputs to specify a turbocharger.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb2\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li359\ri8428\sl244\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Assume at this time you are not considering an intercooler, so leave Intercooler\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 Eff\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 %\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 at\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 0,\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 No\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 Intercooler. Like many performance enthusiasts, you do not know\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 details about different\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 turbochargers,\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 so\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 you\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 will\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 let the program pick turbocharger specs. This is done by clicking on the Type item at the top of the Turbocharger section. Since your 302 is street driven, you should try a small turbocharger.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Small turbochargers "come on" quicker, at a lower RPM, which is better suited for the street.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li359\ri8574\sl244\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Select\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 Estimate\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 Small\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 Turbo\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 from the list of Types.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb228\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li359\ri8429\sl244\slmult1\sb1\f0\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Also,\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 turbo\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 supplier\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 recommends\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 a waste gate to limit boost to 10 PSI of boost, so enter 10 for Wastegate\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Limit, PSI.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 The Turbocharger specs should now look like those in Figure \expnd0\expndtw-2 4.38.\par\sect\sectd\sbkpage\headery365\footery644\margtsxn740\margbsxn840\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb115\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par
