\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li359\ri10008\sl244\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Figure\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 4.63\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 shows a comparison of the Baseline with the\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 runners\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 giving optimum tuning from the \'933rd reflected pulse\'94 otherwise known as resonance tuning.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 You can see that these runner\expnd-3\expndtw-13  \expnd0\expndtw0 dimensions also produce a significant power improvement at 8000 RPM.\par\sect\sectd\sbkpage\headery365\footery644\margtsxn740\margbsxn840\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb119\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\ri821\sl244\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Figure 4.64 shows that\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 both the Optimum\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 Inertia Tuning runner and Third Pulse runner give good performance through the 7000-9000 RPM range, but overall the Optimum Inertia Tuning runner is best.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb3\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\ri821\sl244\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Although this example shows resonance tuning to have a significant\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 effect, most\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 engines with shorter runners, less overlap and lower RPM ranges should be designed for optimum inertia tuning.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par
